      "text": "Commercial dental PPO benefit structure used for real-time benefit verification in UC02b-I1 (a named test objective: implant coverage, waiting-period status, and remaining annual maximum, in contrast to UC02a's binary Medicaid PA check). Annual maximum $2,000/member/year; at Frank's 2026-07-08 benefit check, $1,720 remained (the per-episode remaining balance is carried on Coverage/coverage-frank-castle-commercial, since it is member- and point-in-time-specific rather than a fixed plan attribute). No prior authorization required for D7210 or D6010 under this plan design. Synthetic placeholder plan — see Organization/org-commercial-dental-ppo."
